# Proxy fleet deploy

## Secrets

| Secret | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| `PROXY_FLEET_JSON` | base64 of fleet JSON (see `C:\keys\bastyon\proxy-fleet`) |
| `PNTBSTPRX_SSH_KEY` | shared private key on all fleet hosts |

Local encode: `C:\keys\bastyon\proxy-fleet\encode-secret.ps1 -Copy`

Fleet fields per host: `id`, `ip`, `host`, `sshUser`, `admin` (required non-empty), `email` (Let's Encrypt).

## Workflow

`.github/workflows/deploy.proxy.fleet.yml` — `workflow_dispatch` only.

1. Build `ghcr.io/<owner>/pocketnet-proxy:proxy16`
2. Decode fleet → matrix
3. Per host: LE cert → `/opt/proxy/cert/` → pull image → bootstrap (admin/domain/enabled) → up

